{"id":"42776dd9b2915027","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-verification-calculus.md","title":"伪 Π¹₁ 句的无穷验证演算","display":"df-verification-calculus — 伪 Π¹₁ 句的无穷验证演算","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-verification-calculus","aliases":["18-df-verification-calculus"],"display":"df-verification-calculus — 伪 Π¹₁ 句的无穷验证演算","depends_on":["[[18-df-characteristic-sequence]]","[[18-df-ordinal]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Definition 5.4.3","source_pages":"77–78","source_pdf_pages":"87–88","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-verification-calculus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-verification-calculus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-verification-calculus — 伪 Π¹₁ 句的无穷验证演算"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5cc25b794abadf8c\" href=\"?note=5cc25b794abadf8c\" title=\"18-df-characteristic-sequence\">18-df-characteristic-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 5.4.3"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"77–78"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"87–88"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\mathsf C,\\mathsf D,\\mathrm{CS},\\operatorname{val}\">\\(\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\mathsf C,\\mathsf D,\\mathrm{CS},\\operatorname{val}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5cc25b794abadf8c\" href=\"?note=5cc25b794abadf8c\" title=\"18-df-characteristic-sequence\">18-df-characteristic-sequence</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^\\alpha\">\\(V^\\alpha\\)</span> 是按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 超限递归定义的有限公式集谓词。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span> 为算术语言上游的闭项集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm N}(\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists s,t\\in\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\,\\exists X\\in\\mathcal X\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t)\\land\\{s\\in X,t\\notin X\\}\\subseteq\\Delta\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm N}(\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists s,t\\in\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\,\\exists X\\in\\mathcal X\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t)\\land\\{s\\in X,t\\notin X\\}\\subseteq\\Delta\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nV^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm N}(\\Delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathsf C\\ \\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{CS}(F))\\ \\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\,\nV^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CS}(F)(i)\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathsf D\\ \\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{CS}(F))\\ \\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\,\nV^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CS}(F)(i)\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nV^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm N}(\\Delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathsf C\\ \\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{CS}(F))\\ \\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\,\nV^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CS}(F)(i)\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathsf D\\ \\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{CS}(F))\\ \\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\,\nV^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CS}(F)(i)\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐项对应 Definition 5.4.3。右式只调用严格较小高度，故超限递归确定唯一关系；不把“最小闭包”当作无解释口号。真数值原子由合取分支的空全称获得，集成员对由 Ax 获得，空相继式两者均无。Δ 作有限析取解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-characteristic-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"5cc25b794abadf8c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-characteristic-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-characteristic-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"5cc25b794abadf8c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$，$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$；$\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\mathsf C,\\mathsf D,\\mathrm{CS},\\operatorname{val}$ 见 [[18-df-characteristic-sequence]]。$V^\\alpha$ 是按 $\\alpha$ 超限递归定义的有限公式集谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\mathsf C,\\mathsf D,\\mathrm{CS},\\operatorname{val}","display":false},{"tex":"V^\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm N}(\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists s,t\\in\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\,\\exists X\\in\\mathcal X\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t)\\land\\{s\\in X,t\\notin X\\}\\subseteq\\Delta\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nV^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm N}(\\Delta)\\\\\n&\\lor\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathsf C\\ \\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{CS}(F))\\ \\exists\\beta<\\alpha\\,\nV^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CS}(F)(i)\\})\\\\\n&\\lor\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathsf D\\ \\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{CS}(F))\\ \\exists\\beta<\\alpha\\,\nV^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CS}(F)(i)\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1877,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-verification-calculus]]"},{"id":"8accc2f8cbc49eab","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$，$\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$。$\\mathsf C,\\mathsf D,\\mathrm{CS},\\sim_{\\mathrm N},\\mathrm{rk}_{\\mathrm N}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm N}$ 分别取 [[18-df-characteristic-sequence]]、[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]、[[18-df-verification-calculus]] 的定义。对每个固定切秩界 $\\rho$，按高度 $\\alpha$ 定义 $D_\\rho^\\alpha$；下标界严格限制切公式秩。"},{"id":"fdadd493aba9167e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}$ 取 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]；$V^\\alpha$ 取 [[18-df-verification-calculus]]，$\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}$ 取 [[18-df-church-kleene-ordinal]]。$F^\\nabla$ 在有限公式树上递归，收集顶层析取分支。$\\mathrm{Cl}_1(F),\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)$ 取 [[18-df-analytic-prenex-formula]]；前者包含全部自由集合变量的所有无重复全称闭包，后者是按固定枚举选取的代表。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-verification-calculus]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-verification-calculus]]"}],"outgoing":["5cc25b794abadf8c","cf95026e035bcb2b"]}